\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8\u6a2a_2560\u00d71440.png", "id": "1528269601672457", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_1528269605005790_523553447105837707_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hCiPqcekzuIQ7kNvwGTuvAB&_nc_oc=AdrzW4Rhlojk-gEFoDt_HUod8kJykYI_9up3Msu0JOmWWpOHbEDJJU6SuiEFVSv-ZDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJVOCPaxOjRwg6KyKXGhUjBRK1XUgm_0wwMjxUUVQ7Yw&oe=6B00793B"}, "display_name": "Spatial Disk", "keywords": ["character", "video", "virtual", "anime", "live"], "long_description": "\u3010What is Spatial Disk?\u3011\nSpatial Disk is a new visual entertainment service that transforms past VR and 3D live performances into high-quality 3D experiences you can easily enjoy on your MetaQuest.\n\nLike DVDs or Blu-rays, you can purchase past live shows and replay them anytime, on your favorite device.\nRelive the excitement of immersive live performances\u2014anytime, anywhere, right on your MetaQuest.\n\n\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\n\n\u25c6Experience the Live Show \u201cIn Spacial\u201d\nFeel the depth and immersion that flat videos can\u2019t deliver.\nIt\u2019s like being there at the concert all over again.\n\n\u25c6One-Time Purchase, Yours Forever\nOwn your favorite live shows digitally\u2014just like Blu-rays.\nEnjoy them anytime without subscription or streaming limits.\n\n\u25c6Enjoy smooth playback, even for demanding 3D live shows.\nBecause the performances are pre-rendered as video, even heavy 3D content plays back smoothly.\nEnjoy high-quality live shows without any lag or stress.\n\n\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc", "short_description": "This is a new video experience service that turns past VR and 3D live events into high-quality 3D footage that can be easily enjoyed on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gugenka.jp/services/spatialdisk/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gugenka.jp/services/spatialdi